&lt;li&gt;Strong publications record at ICML, ICLR, AAAI, NeurIPS, UAI, KDD, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and predictable availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
