Point72::point72_8003977002.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point72 is looking for a Quantitative Analyst to join its Fund Flow Research team. The Fund Flow Group provides best in class flow and positioning indicators to help PMs, analysts, and traders across all investment functions understand their investment backdrop, better assess reward and risk, and identify alpha opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine and advance current product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to research efforts formalizing and building new models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in daily workflow contributing to internal communications and data production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with PMs and analysts to answer questions and identify needs and additional features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree or higher in a technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quant research or development experience at a financial institution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with time series and point in time data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for research, markets, and problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, exceptional attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to the highest ethical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

Cubist Systematic Strategies::gh_point72.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2026 Point72 Academy Case Competition—New York City&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Point72 Academy Case Competition is your chance to showcase your investing skills by presenting a stock pitch to Point72 with a team from your university.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You and one to three teammates will analyze a company, develop an investment thesis using publicly available sources only, and submit your pitch. Finalists will be paired with a Point72 mentor and given the opportunity to present their pitch to Point72 investment professionals in our New York City office. Prizes include scholarships and an accelerated interview process for future opportunities. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prep your pitch: &lt;/strong&gt;Research a company selected by Point72, develop your investment thesis using publicly available sources only, and bring your analysis to life in a presentation. You’re encouraged to use AI thoughtfully to support your research and analysis.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine with a Mentor:&lt;/strong&gt; If your team is selected as a finalist, you’ll be paired with a Point72 mentor who will provide feedback as you prepare for the final round.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Present your case: &lt;/strong&gt;Finalist teams will travel to New York City to present their investment pitch to Point72 investors. You’ll also network with your peers and representatives from our recruiting, Academy, and investing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
