&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3257&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
