&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High ownership and bias for action in 0→1 environments&lt;/strong&gt;: you are comfortable making pragmatic trade-offs, operating with incomplete information, and driving projects from idea through launch and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to collaborate across product, engineering, and design teams to align technical strategy with company growth objectives.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern JavaScript frameworks (e.g., React, Angular, or VueJs/Ember)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience with server-side web technologies (eg: Node.js, Java, Python, Scala, C#, C++,Go)&lt;/li&gt;
