&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills; ability to express complex concepts in simple terms, especially to non-experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of basic probability, statistical inference, software solvers, mathematical optimization is a plus, but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and experience in LLM, agentic systems is a plus, but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
