Point72::point72_7661997002.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Role/Responsibilities:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a quantitative researcher to join an NLP quant team within Point72. We believe the significant advances in NLP methods show promise for finance. We develop and launch end-to-end signals, from data processing to performance testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have strong machine learning, data science and software engineering skills, some experience with modern NLP, and a curiosity about finance and trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities may include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using NLP to construct features from varied datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulating research hypotheses to derive alpha&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and testing the performance of trading signals based on NLP and financial features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launching identified signals into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Requirements: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s, Master’s or PhD degree in computer science or other quantitative discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Python and general software engineering principles (github, testing, dev workflow)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of machine learning and statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior research experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with deep learning, specifically NLP (PyTorch, HuggingFace, LLMs, etc.) preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data science stack familiarity preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to the highest ethical standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Point72:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point72 Asset Management is a global firm led by Steven Cohen that invests in multiple asset classes and strategies worldwide. Resting on more than a quarter-century of investing experience, we seek to be the industry’s premier asset manager through delivering superior risk-adjusted returns, adhering to the highest ethical standards, and offering the greatest opportunities to the industry’s brightest talent.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;We’re inventing the future of finance by revolutionizing how we develop our people and how we use data to shape our thinking. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;www.Point72.com/working-here.&lt;/p&gt;

Point72::point72_8488485002.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Career with Point72&#39;s Steven &amp;amp; Alexandra Cohen Foundation/Office of Inclusion and Community Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Steven &amp;amp; Alexandra Cohen Foundation is a nonprofit organization committed to inspiring philanthropy and community service, leading by example to show the world what giving can do. Working closely with the Foundation, the Office of Inclusion &amp;amp; Community is the engine that drives the philanthropic culture and strong sense of community among the employees of Point72, a global asset management company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality, on-brand digital collateral for social media, web, and external communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape visual narratives for reports and presentations, translating data and philanthropic impact into polished layouts, graphics, and design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Foundation and Community websites through content edits, page creation, and visual updates using the Amazin’ Mets Foundation’s content management system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communications plans and programs that advance the Amazin’ Mets Foundation’s mission and the philanthropic vision of its leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize communications materials, including press releases, media advisories, annual reports, and coverage summaries that reinforce the Foundation’s story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage mailing lists, distribution, and engagement tracking for internal and external communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build content calendars for social and digital channels, coordinating creation, and delivery across the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance and quarterly reporting, identifying insights that improve audience engagement and strengthen future storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply artificial intelligence and automation tools to streamline monitoring, reporting, and data tracking while reducing manual processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal and external creators, including designers, video editors, Mets photographers, and production teams, to deliver compelling content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of digital communications experience, including social media and visual content creation for digital platforms and print materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio demonstrating visual storytelling, digital design, and brand-aligned creative work across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Adobe Creative Cloud, Canva, Microsoft Office, and digital communications platforms including Mailchimp, Hootsuite, and Classy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong digital copywriting, written and verbal communication, and editorial judgment to identify high-quality content opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shooting and editing video and photos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and project management skills, with the ability to meet deadlines and manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment, discretion, and attention to detail when handling sensitive information and fast-moving situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work flexible hours, including nights, weekends, and holidays, with some local and non-local travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to the highest ethical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We take care of our people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our people, their careers, their health, and their well-being. When you work here, we provide:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
