&lt;li&gt;Analyze large data sets using advanced statistical methods to identify trading opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of market structure of various exchanges and asset classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
