&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8566&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Questions?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Get in touch with the recruitment team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;cc-1rn59kg&quot; href=&quot;mailto:careers@optiver.com.au&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careers@optiver.com.au&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
