&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think creatively, to come up with and implement original research and ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills; recognised by peers as an expert in one’s domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of statistics/ML and an ability to apply it to real world problems&lt;/li&gt;
