&lt;li&gt;Experience in intraday alpha research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building ML models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with handling large data sets and tick data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
