&lt;li&gt;Programming skills (strong in Python and/or C/C++ but comfortable in both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious and self-motivated&amp;nbsp;Ability to communicate within and across teams, at a high and low level, on both technical and non-technical subjects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to seek guidance and learn new skills from peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extraordinary mental flexibility and a high tolerance for ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong drive for success within a collaborative team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
