&lt;li&gt;Commuting Made Easy:&amp;nbsp;Commuter benefit plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Cover:&amp;nbsp;Personal travel insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Perks:&amp;nbsp;Catered lunches, fully stocked kitchen, laundry service, onsite gym, yoga and HIIT classes, barber, and hairdresser service&lt;/li&gt;
