&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply statistical and machine learning methods across diverse datasets to build trading models that capture novel signals in market behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will contribute across the full strategy lifecycle — from alpha research and signal generation to portfolio optimization and execution logic.&lt;/li&gt;
