&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of prior work experience in statistical arbitrage or systematic trading research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to conduct research with large, noisy real-world datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills, with proficiency in Python for data analysis and machine learning. Experience with C++ a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
