&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1459&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;Previous experience in finance, ideally within a hedge fund or trading environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1595&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AWS or similar cloud platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Experience building dashboards or working with data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
