&lt;li&gt;You have strong coding skills in Python and SQL, with the ability to efficiently work with and manage large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a financial institution or audit firm is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess excellent communication skills, allowing you to clearly explain complex data issues and methodologies to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;enhanced experience and learning opportunities at QRT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
